{"seq":1,"slug":"lut","title":"LUT 原理与应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/lut","wordCount":1737,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"lut-原理与应用\">LUT 原理与应用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LUT 把复杂的色彩变换压缩为一次查表操作，其核心要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本质是映射表</strong>：LUT 是预计算的三维数组，把输入 RGB 值映射为输出 RGB 值，用查表换取了计算效率。</li>\n<li><strong>1D vs 3D</strong>：1D LUT 每通道独立、只能做曲线/Gamma/增益；3D LUT 支持通道交叉，能表达任意色彩变换但精度受网格限制。</li>\n<li><strong>技术 vs 创意</strong>：技术 LUT 执行客观数学变换（如 Log→Rec.709），创意 LUT 承载主观审美（胶片模拟、橙青调），二者职责泾渭分明。</li>\n<li><strong>节点链顺序</strong>：一次校正在 LUT 之前、创意 LUT 在技术 LUT 之后、肤色保护在创意 LUT 之后，顺序错了输入状态就不一致。</li>\n<li><strong>LUT 不等于万能</strong>：它假设固定输入范围、无法处理 HDR、会丢失空间信息，极端输入还会导致色域溢出。</li>\n<li><strong>DCTL 突破限制</strong>：DCTL 用着色器语言实现参数化、&quot;智能&quot;的变换，弥补了传统 LUT 无法自适应曝光与 HDR 的短板。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lut-的技术本质\">LUT 的技术本质</h2><p>LUT（Look-Up Table，查找表）是一种将输入色彩值映射为输出色彩值的数学变换工具。本质上，LUT 是一个预计算的三维数组，每个维度对应 R、G、B 通道之一，存储了所有可能输入组合对应的输出值。在调色工作流中，LUT 用于快速应用复杂的色彩变换——将需要数十个参数的调整压缩为一次查表操作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;LUT 工作原理&quot;&#10;        INPUT[&quot;输入像素 (R,G,B)&quot;] --&gt; INDEX[&quot;查表索引计算&quot;]&#10;        INDEX --&gt; LOOKUP[&quot;3D 数组查找&quot;]&#10;        LOOKUP --&gt; INTERP[&quot;三线性插值&quot;]&#10;        INTERP --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;输出像素 (R&#39;,G&#39;,B&#39;)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;LUT 类型&quot;&#10;        T1[&quot;1D LUT: 单通道独立映射&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;3D LUT: 三通道交叉映射&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"LUT 工作原理\"\n        INPUT[\"输入像素 (R,G,B)\"] --&gt; INDEX[\"查表索引计算\"]\n        INDEX --&gt; LOOKUP[\"3D 数组查找\"]\n        LOOKUP --&gt; INTERP[\"三线性插值\"]\n        INTERP --&gt; OUTPUT[\"输出像素 (R',G',B')\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"LUT 类型\"\n        T1[\"1D LUT: 单通道独立映射\"]\n        T2[\"3D LUT: 三通道交叉映射\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"1d-lut-vs-3d-lut\">1D LUT vs 3D LUT</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>1D LUT</th>\n<th>3D LUT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维度</td>\n<td>1 维（每通道独立）</td>\n<td>3 维（通道交叉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点数</td>\n<td>256-4096 per channel</td>\n<td>17³-65³ (4913-274625)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件大小</td>\n<td>几 KB</td>\n<td>几十 KB - 数 MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力</td>\n<td>曲线、Gamma、增益</td>\n<td>任意色彩变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局限</td>\n<td>不能做交叉通道操作</td>\n<td>精度受限于网格大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>技术转换（Log→Linear）</td>\n<td>创意 Look / 风格化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>3D LUT 查找</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Output</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>LUT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>where </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{3D LUT 查找}: \\text{Output}(R,G,B) = \\text{LUT}[i][j][k] \\quad \\text{where}\\ i = \\lfloor R \\times (N-1) \\rfloor,\\ j = \\lfloor G \\times (N-1) \\rfloor,\\ k = \\lfloor B \\times (N-1) \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3D LUT </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">查找</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Output</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LUT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">where</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌋</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌋</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌋</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是 LUT 的立方体边长（常见值：17、33、65）。当输入值落在网格点之间时，使用三线性插值（Trilinear Interpolation）计算精确输出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lut-文件格式\">LUT 文件格式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>扩展名</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>.cube</td>\n<td>.cube</td>\n<td>Adobe/Iridas</td>\n<td>最通用，文本格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.3dl</td>\n<td>.3dl</td>\n<td>Autodesk</td>\n<td>电影工业标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.csp</td>\n<td>.csp</td>\n<td>Rising Sun Research</td>\n<td>Cinespace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.mga</td>\n<td>.mga</td>\n<td>Pandora</td>\n<td>DI 设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.spi3d</td>\n<td>.spi3d</td>\n<td>Sony</td>\n<td>ACES/OCIO 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.dctl</td>\n<td>.dctl</td>\n<td>Blackmagic</td>\n<td>DaVinci Resolve 专用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>.cube 格式是当前最广泛支持的 LUT 文件格式，结构为纯文本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 标题和注释&#10;LUT_3D_SIZE 33&#10;DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0&#10;DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0&#10;0.000000 0.000000 0.000000&#10;0.003906 0.000000 0.000000&#10;...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 标题和注释</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LUT_3D_SIZE 33</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>0.000000 0.000000 0.000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>0.003906 0.000000 0.000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lut-的分类与应用场景\">LUT 的分类与应用场景</h2><h3 id=\"技术-lut-technical-lut\">技术 LUT（Technical LUT）</h3><p>技术 LUT 执行客观的数学变换，不含主观审美判断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术 LUT 类型</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Log-to-Rec.709</td>\n<td>S-Log3 / C-Log3</td>\n<td>Rec.709</td>\n<td>现场监看</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Camera IDT</td>\n<td>特定相机 Log</td>\n<td>ACES</td>\n<td>色彩管理输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ODT</td>\n<td>ACES</td>\n<td>Rec.709/P3</td>\n<td>色彩管理输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CST (Color Space Transform)</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>通用色彩空间转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"创意-lut-creative-lut-look-lut\">创意 LUT（Creative LUT / Look LUT）</h3><p>创意 LUT 包含调色师的主观风格——色调偏移、对比度曲线、饱和度处理等审美决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风格类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>常见来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电影胶片模拟</td>\n<td>高光滚降、暗部提升、色彩偏移</td>\n<td>Kodak 2383 / Fuji 3510</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>橙青色调 (Teal &amp; Orange)</td>\n<td>暗部偏青、肤色偏橙</td>\n<td>好莱坞商业片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去饱和冷调</td>\n<td>低饱和度、蓝绿偏移</td>\n<td>北欧犯罪片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高对比暖调</td>\n<td>高反差、暖色调</td>\n<td>广告/MV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复古胶片</td>\n<td>黑色提升、饱和度降低、颗粒</td>\n<td>怀旧/文艺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>创意 LUT 应用强度</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Output</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>LUT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{创意 LUT 应用强度}: \\text{Output} = (1-\\alpha) \\times \\text{Input} + \\alpha \\times \\text{LUT}(\\text{Input}),\\quad \\alpha \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">创意</span><span class=\"mord\"> LUT </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应用强度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Output</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LUT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"lut-使用的最佳实践\">LUT 使用的最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"lut-在节点链中的位置\">LUT 在节点链中的位置</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    N1[&quot;Node 1\\n一次校正\\n(白平衡/曝光)&quot;] --&gt; N2[&quot;Node 2\\n色彩平衡&quot;]&#10;    N2 --&gt; N3[&quot;Node 3\\n技术 LUT\\n(Log→Linear)&quot;]&#10;    N3 --&gt; N4[&quot;Node 4\\n创意 LUT\\n(Look)&quot;]&#10;    N4 --&gt; N5[&quot;Node 5\\n二次校正\\n(肤色保护)&quot;]&#10;    N5 --&gt; N6[&quot;Node 6\\nOutput Transform&quot;]\">graph LR\n    N1[\"Node 1\\n一次校正\\n(白平衡/曝光)\"] --&gt; N2[\"Node 2\\n色彩平衡\"]\n    N2 --&gt; N3[\"Node 3\\n技术 LUT\\n(Log→Linear)\"]\n    N3 --&gt; N4[\"Node 4\\n创意 LUT\\n(Look)\"]\n    N4 --&gt; N5[\"Node 5\\n二次校正\\n(肤色保护)\"]\n    N5 --&gt; N6[\"Node 6\\nOutput Transform\"]</pre><p><strong>关键原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>一次校正在 LUT <strong>之前</strong>——确保输入到 LUT 的素材状态一致</li>\n<li>创意 LUT 在技术 LUT <strong>之后</strong>——创意 LUT 期望标准化的输入</li>\n<li>肤色保护在创意 LUT <strong>之后</strong>——修正 LUT 可能带来的肤色偏移</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"lut-的局限性\">LUT 的局限性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精度有限</td>\n<td>网格点之间需插值</td>\n<td>使用 65³ 高精度 LUT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不适应不同曝光</td>\n<td>LUT 假设固定输入范围</td>\n<td>先做曝光校正再应用 LUT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无法处理 HDR</td>\n<td>大多数 LUT 为 SDR 设计</td>\n<td>使用 HDR 专用 LUT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢失空间信息</td>\n<td>LUT 是逐像素操作</td>\n<td>配合 Power Window 使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色彩溢出</td>\n<td>极端输入导致色域外值</td>\n<td>添加色域限制节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"自制-lut-流程\">自制 LUT 流程</h3><ol>\n<li>在 DaVinci Resolve 中建立完整节点链</li>\n<li>对标准测试素材应用全部调整</li>\n<li>导出为 .cube 文件（Generate 3D LUT）</li>\n<li>选择网格精度（33³ 通用，65³ 高质量）</li>\n<li>在其他项目/软件中加载使用</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LUT 精度要求</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>33</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>通用</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>65</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>HDR/宽色域</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LUT 精度要求}: N_{grid} \\geq 33 \\quad (\\text{通用}),\\quad N_{grid} \\geq 65 \\quad (\\text{HDR/宽色域})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LUT </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">精度要求</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通用</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HDR/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">宽色域</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"dctl-与动态-lut\">DCTL 与动态 LUT</h2><h3 id=\"dctl-davinci-color-transform-language\">DCTL（DaVinci Color Transform Language）</h3><p>DCTL 是 DaVinci Resolve 的着色器语言，允许创建参数化的色彩变换——突破传统 LUT 的&quot;一次性查表&quot;限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>传统 LUT</th>\n<th>DCTL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数可调</td>\n<td>✗ 固定</td>\n<td>✓ 滑块控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度</td>\n<td>受网格限制</td>\n<td>数学精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HDR 适应</td>\n<td>需多版本</td>\n<td>自适应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曝光依赖</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>可编程补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发难度</td>\n<td>低（调色即可）</td>\n<td>中高（需编程）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DCTL 使得调色师可以创建&quot;智能 LUT&quot;——根据输入信号的动态特征自适应调整输出，而非固定映射。这在 HDR 和宽色域工作流中尤为重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lut-管理与组织\">LUT 管理与组织</h2><h3 id=\"专业-lut-库管理\">专业 LUT 库管理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管理维度</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>命名规范</td>\n<td><code>[用途]_[风格]_[输入空间]_[版本].cube</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录结构</td>\n<td>按 Technical / Creative / Camera 分类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本控制</td>\n<td>标注创建日期和适用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预览系统</td>\n<td>生成缩略图预览表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档记录</td>\n<td>每个 LUT 记录设计意图和最佳输入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>截至 2026 年，行业中常用的 LUT 管理工具包括 LUT Robot（自动化预览）、Lattice（LUT 编辑器）和 OCIO（OpenColorIO 配置系统）。大型后期公司通常在 OCIO config 中集中管理所有技术和创意 LUT。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>LUT 是一种把复杂色彩变换预计算为查表的工具，本质上是三维映射数组，用效率换取了灵活性。它分为 1D 与 3D 两类——前者每通道独立、适合曲线式变换，后者支持通道交叉、能表达任意色彩变换。按职责又分为技术 LUT（客观转换）与创意 LUT（主观风格），在节点链中有固定的先后顺序：一次校正 → 技术 LUT → 创意 LUT → 肤色保护。LUT 的精度受网格大小限制，且不适应不同曝光、无法处理 HDR、会丢失空间信息，因此需配合 Power Window 或色域限制使用。DCTL 通过参数化着色器弥补了这些短板，让&quot;智能 LUT&quot;成为可能；面向 HDR/宽色域时则应选用 65³ 甚至更高精度的 LUT。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LUT 原理与应用","id":"lut-原理与应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LUT 的技术本质","id":"lut-的技术本质"},{"level":3,"text":"1D LUT vs 3D LUT","id":"1d-lut-vs-3d-lut"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT 文件格式","id":"lut-文件格式"},{"level":2,"text":"LUT 的分类与应用场景","id":"lut-的分类与应用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"技术 LUT（Technical LUT）","id":"技术-lut-technical-lut"},{"level":3,"text":"创意 LUT（Creative LUT / Look LUT）","id":"创意-lut-creative-lut-look-lut"},{"level":2,"text":"LUT 使用的最佳实践","id":"lut-使用的最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT 在节点链中的位置","id":"lut-在节点链中的位置"},{"level":3,"text":"LUT 的局限性","id":"lut-的局限性"},{"level":3,"text":"自制 LUT 流程","id":"自制-lut-流程"},{"level":2,"text":"DCTL 与动态 LUT","id":"dctl-与动态-lut"},{"level":3,"text":"DCTL（DaVinci Color Transform Language）","id":"dctl-davinci-color-transform-language"},{"level":2,"text":"LUT 管理与组织","id":"lut-管理与组织"},{"level":3,"text":"专业 LUT 库管理","id":"专业-lut-库管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/color-balance"},"next":{"title":"色调映射与风格化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/creative-grading/tone-mapping-style"}}